{# BrandMind — Human Escalation Message Template #}
{% include "system_base.j2" %}

ESCALATION REASON:
{{ escalation_reason }}

ESCALATION TOOL SUCCEEDED:
{{ escalation_succeeded }}

ESCALATION RECORD STATUS:
{{ escalation_status }}

CUSTOMER MESSAGE:
<customer_message>
{{ customer_message }}
</customer_message>

INSTRUCTIONS:
If the escalation tool succeeded and returned a record status, state briefly that the request was recorded for human review. This does not mean a human agent has joined; do not promise a response time.
If the escalation tool failed or returned no status, clearly say that the request was not submitted and do not imply that a handoff occurred. Do not expose internal errors; give one practical next step.
Mirror the customer's language and dialect. Keep the message concise, professional, and free of automatic greetings or emojis.
